--- @param byte_count number Maximum number of bytes to consume.
--- @return table R1 Array of instruction tables. Empty if Capstone failed to initialise or could not decode any instructions.
function ffi.disasm.at_bytes(address, byte_count) end --- @diagnostic disable-line

