--- | Code | C type |
--- |------|--------|
--- | `v`  | void (return only) |
--- | `i`  | int32_t |
--- | `u`  | uint32_t |
--- | `l`  | int64_t |
--- | `f`  | float |
--- | `d`  | double |
--- | `b`  | bool / uint8_t |
--- | `p`  | pointer (passed as `number`) |
--- | `s`  | const char\* (passed as `string`, or `0` if null) |
